{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Combat｜近战判定流程\n结构与接口见 [[GGYGO_结构_Combat.canvas|结构图]]；伤害后续见 [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1710,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "open",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. GA 收到 Montage Event，BeginTraceWindow 设置 Socket/Radius，清本窗口已命中集合。\n\n调用：BossMeleeAbility::HandleMontageEvent → MeleeTrace::BeginTraceWindow(StartSocket, EndSocket, Radius)，重置去重集合。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "baseline",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. 窗口首帧只记录武器两端位置，不生成从旧动画到新动画的虚假扫掠。\n\n调用：MeleeTrace::PerformTrace 首次仅记录 Mesh::GetSocketLocation 两端，避免跨窗口虚假命中。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "sweep",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 后续每帧用上一帧与本帧线段连续扫掠，按通道过滤候选。\n\nTickComponent → PerformTrace：以上一帧/本帧 Socket 采样点做 SweepMultiByChannel。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "dedupe",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 已命中 Actor 跳过；新命中进入窗口集合，广播 OnMeleeHit。\n\nPerformTrace 查 HitActorsThisWindow；首次命中 OnMeleeHit.Broadcast(Actor, HitResult)。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 392,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "ge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. GA 解释 HitResult、材质和目标，应用伤害 GE/Cue。\n\nGA::HandleMeleeHit 接委托 → SourceASC::MakeOutgoingSpec / Spec::SetSetByCallerMagnitude / SourceASC::ApplyGameplayEffectSpecToTarget。",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "close",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. Montage Event 结束或 GA 取消时 EndTraceWindow，停止判定 Tick。\n\n调用：BossMeleeAbility 事件结束或 EndAbility → MeleeTrace::EndTraceWindow；停止 Tick 扫掠。",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "open",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "baseline",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "开启窗口"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "baseline",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "基线有效"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "sweep",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "dedupe",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "获得命中候选"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "ge",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "首次命中"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "ge",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "close",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "动画窗口结束"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "dedupe",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "sweep",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "下一帧继续"
    }
  ]
}
